@startuml
actor Developer
participant "Config Server" as CS
participant "Git Repository" as GIT
participant "Microservice" as MS

Developer -> CS: Start Config Server
CS -> GIT: Fetch configuration files
GIT --> CS: Return configuration

Developer -> MS: Start Microservice
MS -> CS: Request configuration (application-{profile}.yml)
CS --> MS: Return configuration properties

MS -> MS: Load configuration\nand complete startup

Developer -> MS: (Optional) Trigger /actuator/refresh
MS -> CS: Request updated configuration
CS --> MS: Return latest configuration
MS -> MS: Refresh beans/properties
@enduml
